  "body": "Great work so far. Happy to see progress here. Just one quick thing I'd like to point out is that the regex approach here certainly is not the fastest. I haven't read through everything in detail get so forgive me if I've missed something. I wanted to at least point towards the radix based approach that the fastify framework uses for parsing and matching https://github.com/delvedor/find-my-way. ",
